ied above. \par                            (e) Fixed Rate Day Count \par                             Fraction(s):                     Actual/Actual ICMA \par                            (f) Calculation of Interest      As soon as practicable and in \par                             Amount:                          accordance with the procedure \par                                                              specified herein, the Calculation \par                                                              Agent will determine the IDR Rate \par                                                              (as defined below) and calculate \par                                                              the amount of interest payable \par                                                              (the "Interest Amount") with respect \par                                                              to each minimum Authorized Denomination \par                                                              for the relevant Interest Period. \par                                                              The Interest Amount with respect \par                                                              to any Interest Period shall be \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inter-American Development Bank Issue of Debt -2-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                              a USD amount calculated on the \par                                                              relevant Rate Fixing Date (as \par                                                              defined below) as follows: \par                                                              7.875% times the minimum Authorized \par                                                              Denomination \par  \par                                                              times \par  \par                                                              the Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction \