                                                Rate USD - IDR", or on Thomson \par                                                              Reuters Screen JISDOR Page (or \par                                                              on such replacement page or replacement \par                                                              service as described above), or \par                                                              be otherwise made available by \par                                                              \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor \par                                                              as administrator), on the Rate \par                                                              Fixing Date, then the IDR Rate \par                                                              for such Rate Fixing Date shall \par                                                              be determined by the Calculation \par                                                              Agent by requesting quotations \par                                                              for the mid USD/IDR spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign \par                                                              exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate from five banks \par                                                              active in the USD/IDR \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                                              and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets as \par                                                              selected by the Calculation Agent \par                                                              (such banks, the "Reference Banks") \par                                                              either (i) at or about 10:00 a.m. \par                                         