horized Denomination \par  \par                                          divided by \par  \par                                          the IDR Rate \par  \par                                          (and rounding, if necessary, \par                                          the entire resulting figure \par                                          to the nearest 2 decimal places, \par                                          with USD 0.005 being rounded \par                                          upwards). \par  17.   Issuer's Optional Redemption \par         (Condition 6(e)):                No \par  18.   Redemption at the Option \par         of the Noteholders (Condition    No \par         6(f)): \par  \par  \par   19.                     Early Redemption Amount \par                           (including accrued interest,        In the event the Notes become \par                           if applicable) (Condition           due and payable as provided \par                           9):                                 in Condition 9 (Default), the \par                                                               Early Redemption Amount with \par                                                               respect to each minimum Authorized \par                                                               Denomination will be a USD amount \par                                                               equal to the Redemption Amount \par                                                               that is determined in accordance \par                                                               with "16. Redemption Amount" \par                                                               plus accrued and unpaid interest, \par                                                               if any, as determined in accordance \par                                                               with "13. Fixed Interest Rate \par                                    