e\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                               markets are open for business in \par                                               Singapore. \par                                              "Fallback Provisions": Should no \par                                               USD/IDR reference rate appear on \par                                               \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ), \par                                               Thomson Reuters Screen JISDOR Page, \par                                               or Bloomberg Page JISDOR, or be \par                                               otherwise made available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank \par                                               Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor as \par                                               administrator) on the Fixing Date, \par                                               then the USD/IDR reference rate \par                                               for such Fixing Date shall be determined \par                                               by the Calculation Agent by requesting \par                                               quotations for the mid USD/IDR \par                                               spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate either \par                                               (i) at or about 11:00 a.m. Singapore \par                                               time on the first day (other than \par                                               a Saturday or a Sunday) following \par                                               the Fixing Date (if such day is \par                                               a Relevant Business Day) or (ii) \par                                               if the first day (other than a \p