\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  c.bank to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in forward market through auction\b0\par\par\uc2 271 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Oktober 2015\par 10:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, Oct 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the forward \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market through auctions starting this week to sell or buy rupiah, introducing a new tool to stabilise a rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that hit 17-year lows last month.\par \par \uc2 In a regulation uploaded at its website on Thursday, \uc2 Bank Indonesia (BI) \uc2 said banks or intermediary institutions may participate in the auction with minimum transaction of $1 million.\par \par \uc2 The tenders will be either fixed or variable rate tenders, the minimum forward point bid is 1 rupiah.\par \par \uc2 The new regulation also lowered to one week from one-month the minimum holding period for BI-issued rupiah denominated certificates, that is debt paper of up to 12 months.\par \par \uc2 BI Governor Agus Martowardojo said earlier on Thursday that the BI would issue certificate denominated in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from mid-November.\par \par \uc2 Forward \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and lower minimum holding period are part of BI's policy package announced in September in response to volatility in the rupiah exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 The package had heralded the plan to issue securities in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and also to offer cheaper rates for longer tenure foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps for infrastructure projects.\par \par \uc2 The realization of infrastructure related swap may take sometime because BI is still calculating the rate, BI's executive director of economic and monetary policy Juda Agung said.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah traded at 13,640 per dollar at 0850 GMT, 7.99 percent off the 17-year low struck last month.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting By Gayatri Suroyo; Editing by Simon Cameron-Moore) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-10-29T10:00:28.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020151029ebat00a77\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
