donesia's imports for seven months, above the minimum international standard of three months.\par \par \uc2 Write to I Made Sentana at i-made.sentana@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 October 07, 2015 06:12 ET (10:12 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020151007eba70010t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
