\par\par \uc2 Markets Main\par \b \uc2 Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  to  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 Foreign-Exchange \highlight\uc2  Forwards\b0\par\par\uc2 By I Made Sentana   \par \uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 September 2015\par 12:51\par \uc2 Dow Jones Top North American Financial Services Stories\par \uc2 DJTNAF\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 JAKARTA\u8212\'20\'14\uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  unveiled new measures Wednesday in its latest attempt to support the embattled rupiah, which has fallen to its lowest levels in 17 years.\par \par \uc2 The Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's senior deputy governor, Mirza Adityaswara, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will sell dollars in forward transactions to supplement its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market.\par \par \uc2 To encourage exporters and others to sell dollars in forward transactions, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will raise the minimum amount of forward dollar selling without underlying transactions to $5 million from $1 million.\par \par \uc2 "We also will allow the use of dollar deposits in offshore and onshore banks as underlying documents to back dollar forward selling," he added.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would issue new dollar-denominated notes to attract dollar inflows.\par \par \uc2 At the same time, \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  will reduce the holding period of existing rupiah-denominated SBI notes, popular among foreign investors, to one week from one month, to make them more attractive.\par \par \uc2 Deputy Gov. Perry Warjiyo said the rupiah's fair value according to its underlying fundamentals should be around 13,700 per dollar. This compares with 14,600 per dollar traded in the spot market currently.\par \par \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  said most of the measures will be implemented in October, but gave no specific dates.\par \par \uc2 Write to I Made Sentana   at \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJTNAF1120150930eb9u0000k\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
