t the dollar so far this year.               \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-7-23T04:40:41.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150723eb7n0048x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
