tems under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  1.    Series No.:                                              516 \par  2.    Aggregate Principal Amount:                              IDR 325,000,000,000 \par  3.    Issue Price:                                             IDR 325,000,000,000, which is 100.00 percent of the \par                                                                 Aggregate Principal Amount \par                                                                 The Issue Price will be payable in USD in the amount \par                                                                 of USD 24,583,963.69 at the agreed rate \par                                                                 of 13,220 IDR per one USD \par  4.    Issue Date:                                              June 11, 2015 \par  5.    Form of Notes \par         (Condition 1(a)):                                       Registered only, as further provided in paragraph 9(c) \par                                                                 of "Other Relevant Terms" below. \par  6.    Authorized Denomination(s) \par          (Condition 1(b)):                                       IDR 10,000,000 and integral multiples thereof \par  7.    Specified \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par         (Condition 1(d)):                                       The lawful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the Republic of Indonesia \par                                                                 ("Indonesian Rupiah" or "IDR"), provided \par                                                                 that all payments in respect of the Notes will be made \par                                                                 in United States Dollars ("U.S.$" or \par                                                                 "USD") \par  8.    Specified Principal Payment \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par         (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)): \par                                                                  USD \par  9.    Specified Interest Payment \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par         (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)):                              USD \par  10.   Maturity Date \par         (Condition 6(a); Fixed Interest Rate):                  June 11, 2018 \par                                                                 The Maturity Date is subject to adjustment in \par                                                                 accordance with the Following Business Day Convention \par                                                                 with no adjustment to the amount of interest otherwise \par                                                                 calculated. \par  11.   Interest Basis \par         (Condition 5):                                           Fixed Interest Rate (Condition 5(I)) \par  12.   Interest Commencement Date (Condition 5(III)): \par                                                                  Issue Date (June 11, 2015) \par  13.   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition 5(I)):                    Condition 5(I) as amended and supplemented below, \par                                                                 shall apply to the Notes. The bases of the \par                                                                 calculation of the Interest Amount, Interest Payment \par                                                                 Dates and default interest are as set \par                                                                 out below. \par        (a) Interest Rate:                                       8.00 percent per annum \par        (b) Business Day Convention:                             Following Business Day Convention \par        (c) Fixed Rate Interest Payment Date(s): \par                                                                 Annually on each June 11, commencing on June 11, 2016 \par                                                                 and ending on, and including, the Maturity \par                                                                 Date. \par        (d) Interest Period:                                     Each period from and including each Interest Payment \par                                                                 Date to but excluding the next following \par                                                                 Interest Payment Date, provided that the initial \par                                                                 Interest Period will commence on and include \par                                                                 the Interest Commencement Date, and the final Interest \par                                                                 Period will end on but exclude the \par                                                                 Maturity Date. \par                                                                 For the purposes of the calculation of the Interest \par                                                                 Amount payable for any Interest Period, \par                                                                 there shall be no adjustment pursuant to the Business \par                                                                 Day Convention specified above. \par        (e) Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction(s):                    30/360 \par        (f) Calculation of Interest Amount:                      As soon as practicable and in accordance with the \par                                                                 procedure specified herein, the Calculation \par    