D/IDR \par                                                                 weighted average spot rate in the interbank market, \par                                                                 based on traded USD/IDR spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                                                 transactions during a specified time period which are \par                                                                 captured on a real time basis, expressed \par                                                                 as the amount of IDR per one USD, for settlement in \par                                                                 two IDR Business Days, as published by \par                                                                 \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  as the "Jakarta Interbank Spot Dollar \par                                                                 Rate USD - IDR", which appears on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank \par                                                                 Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ), or as published on \par                                                                 Thomson Reuters Screen JISDOR Page \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 24-06-15 0600GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                                 (or any replacement page or replacement service as may \par                                                                 be implemented for the purposes of \par                                                                 displaying the USD/IDR weighted average spot rate), or \par                                                                 as otherwise made available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank \par                                                                 Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor as administrator), at \par                                                                 approximately 10:00 a.m., Jakarta time, \par                                                                 on the Rate Fixing Date. Fallback Provisions apply as \par                                                                 set out below. \par                                                                 The "Rate Fixing Date" means the date that is five (5) \par                                                                 IDR Business Days prior to the applicable \par                                                                 Fixed Rate Interest Payment Date or Maturity Date, as \par                                                                 the case may be. The Rate Fixing Date \par                                                                 shall be subject to adjustment as follows: if the \par                                                                 scheduled date of the Rate Fixing Date is \par                                                                 not a Relevant Business Day, then the Rate Fixing Date \par                                                                 will be the first preceding day that \par                                                                 is a Relevant Business Day. \par                                                                 "IDR Business Day" means a day (other than a Saturday \par                                                                 or a Sunday) on which banks and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign \par                                                                 exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets are open for business in Jakarta. \par                                                                 "Fallback Provisions": Should no USD/IDR weighted \par                                                                 average spot rate appear on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \par                                                                 website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ) as the "Jakarta Interbank Spot \par                                                                 Dollar Rate USD - IDR", or on Thomson \par                                                                 Reuters Screen JISDOR Page (or on such replacement \par                                                                 page or service as described above), or \par                                                                 be otherwise made available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its \par                                                                 successor as administrator), on the \par                                                                 Rate Fixing Date, then the IDR Rate with respect to \par                                                                 the relevant Interest Period shall be \par                                                                 determined by the Calculation Agent by requesting \par                                                                 quotations for the mid USD/IDR spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign \par                                                                 exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate from five banks active in the USD/IDR \par                                                                 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets \par                                                                 as selected by the Calculation Agent (such banks, the \par                                                                 "Reference Banks") either (i) at or \par                                                                 about 10:00 a.m. Jakarta time on the first calendar \par                                                                 day (other than a Saturday or a Sunday) \par                                                                 following the Rate Fixing Date, if such day is a \par                                                                 Relevant Business Day or (ii) at or about \par                                                                 10:00 a.m. Jakarta time on the Rate Fixing Date, if \par                                                                 the first calendar day (other than a Saturday \par                                                                 or a Sunday) following the Rate Fixing Date is not a \par                                                                 Relevant Business Day. \par                                                                 If five or four quotations are provided by Reference \par                                                                 Banks as requested, the IDR Rate shall \par                                                                 be the arithmetic mean (rounded to the nearest whole \par                                                                 IDR, with IDR 0.5 being rounded upwards) \par                                                                 of the remaining three or two such quotations \par                                                                 (expressed as the number of IDR per one USD), \par                                                                 as the case may be, after disregarding the highest \par                                                                 quotation and the lowest quotation; provided, \par                                                                 that if two or more quotations are the highest \par                                                                 quotations, then only one of such highest quotations \par                                                                 shall be disregarded; and provided further, that if \par                                                                 two or more quotations are the lowest \par                                                                 quotations, then only one of such lowest quotations \par                                                                 shall be disregarded. \par                                                                 If only three or two quotations are provided as \par                                                                 requested, the IDR Rate shall be the arithmetic \par                                                                 mean (rounded to the nearest whole IDR, with IDR 0.5 \par                                                                 being rounded upwards) of such quotations \par                                                                 (expressed as the number of IDR per one USD). \par                                                                 If only one or no quotations are provided as \par                                                                 requested, or if the Calculation Agent determines \par                                                                 in its sole discretion that no suitable Reference \par                                                                 Banks active in the USD/IDR \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  or \par                                                                 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets will provide quotations, the \par                                                                 Calculation Agent shall be entitled \par                                                                 to calculate the IDR Rate acting in good faith in a \par                                                                 commercially reasonable manner, having \par                                                                 taken into account relevant market practice, by \par                                                                 reference to such additional sources as it \par                                                                 deems appropriate; and in such case the Calculation \par                                                                 Agent shall notify the Bank and the Global \par                                                                 Agent as soon as reasonably practicable that the IDR \par                                                                 Rate is to be so determined. \par        (g) Calculation Agent:                                   See "8. Identity of Calculation Agent" under "Other \par                                                                 Relevant Terms" \par        (h) Notification:                                        If the Interest Amount payable on any Interest Payment \par                                                                 Date or the Redemption Amount, as the \par                                                                 case may be, is calculated in any manner other than by \par                                                                 utilizing the USD/IDR weighted average \par                                                                 spot rate that appears on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's website \par                                                                 (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ) as the "Jakarta Interbank \par                                                                 Spot Dollar Rate USD - IDR" or Thomson Reuters Screen \par                                                                 JISDOR Page (or any replacement page \par                                                                 or replacement service as may be implemented for the \par                                                                 purposes of displaying the USD/IDR weighted \par                                                                 average spot rate), or as otherwise made available by \par                                                                 \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor as \par                                                                 administrator), the Global Agent on behalf of the Bank \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 24-06-15 0600GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                                 shall give notice as soon as reasonably \par                                                                 practicable to the Noteholders in accordance with \par                                                                 Condition 14 (Notices). \par  14.   Relevant Financial Center:                               London, New York, Singapore and Jakarta \par  15.   Relevant Business Day:                                   London, New York, Singapore and Jakarta \par  16.   Redemption Amount (Condition 6(a)):                      The Redemption Amount with respect to each minimum \par                                                                 Authorized Denomination will be a USD amount \par                                                                 calculated by the Calculation Agent as of the Rate \par                                                                 Fixing Date with respect to the Maturity \par                                                                 Date as follows: \par                                                                 minimum Authorized Denomination \par                                                                 divided by \par                                                     