\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2- \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2 's rupiah hits 17-yr low, c.bank to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if needed\b0\par\par\uc2 471 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 2015\par 09:00\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Updates with rupiah hitting 17-yr low)\par \par \uc2 By Fransiska Nangoy and Gayatri Suroyo\par \par \uc2 JAKARTA, June 4 (Reuters) - Indonesia's rupiah dropped to a 17-year low against the dollar on Thursday, pressured by slowing economic growth and high inflation in Southeast Asia's largest economy.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah fell 0.4 percent to 13,271 against the dollar, the weakest level since August 1998 when Indonesia was in the depths of a financial crisis that led to the ouster of autocratic leader Suharto.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier on Thursday said it stood ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bond markets to ensure stability.\par \par \uc2 "\uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  will monitor and will always be in the market to calm fluctuations in the exchange rate and the bond prices," \uc2 Peter Jacobs\uc2 , the spokesman said, adding that the rupiah had weakened along with other Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as the U.S. dollar has firmed.\par \par \uc2 The rupiah is the worst performer among emerging Asian economies so far this year, having lost more than 6 percent.\par \par \uc2 The yield on 10-year bonds, which has been rising since Friday, was at 8.325 percent, the highest so far this year.\par \par \uc2 Over the past few months, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has taken several steps aimed at deepening the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and stabilising the rupiah, including relaxing rules on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions and setting hedging rules for Indonesian companies.\par \par \uc2 A ban of dollar usage for all local transactions will take effect on July 1.\par \par \uc2 But the measures have done little to halt the slide in a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weighed down by Indonesia's weakest economic growth since 2009 and the highest inflation since December.\par \par \uc2 "It's not a pretty place to be; sandwiched between disappointing growth and exports, a weakening stock market, and heading into a possible U.S. rate hike later this year," said Philip Wee, senior \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at DBS, who believes the rupiah could weaken to around 13,660 by the end of this year.\par \par \uc2 When the rupiah tumbled in March, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was moving towards a "new normal" and urged investors not to panic.\par \par \uc2 Analysts believe \uc2 Bank Indonesia\uc2  will not battle too hard to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but instead \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to prevent major volatility.\par \par \uc2 "We think \uc2 Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is more open to orderly and gradual depreciation in the IDR over time than many people think," said Santitarn Sathirathai, an economist with \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "After all, BI has noted a few times that a weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could help cut imports, and boost manufacturing exports, supporting the rebalancing of the economy."\par \par \uc2 (Additional reporting by Nicholas Owen and Hidayat Setiaji; Writing by Randy Fabi; Editing by Kim Coghill and Simon Cameron-Moore) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-6-4T08:00:32.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150604eb640066r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
