 to or for the benefit \par                                                                           of any resident of Japan (except \par                                                                           as aforesaid). \par                                                                           (e) General: \par                                                                           No action has been or will be taken \par                                                                           by the Bank that would permit a \par                                                                           public offering of the Notes, or \par                                                                           possession or distribution of any \par                                                                           offering material relating to the \par                                                                           Notes in any jurisdiction where \par                                                                           action for that purpose is required. \par                                                                           Accordingly, the Dealer agrees that \par                                                                           it will observe all applicable provisions \par                                                                           of law in each jurisdiction in or \par                                                                           from which it may offer or sell \par                                                                           Notes or distribute any offering \par                                                                           material. \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.                                                           Listing:   None \par  2.                                        Details of Clearance System   \f28 \uc2 \f2 Euroclear Bank S.A./N.V\f28 \uc2 \f2 . and/or \par                                               Approved by the Bank and    \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Luxembourg \par                                                                    the \par                                             Global Agent and Clearance \par                                                                    and \par                                                 Settlement Procedures: \par  3.                                                        Syndicated:   No \par  4.                                       Commissions and Concessions:   No commissions or concessions are \par                                                                           payable in respect of the Notes. \par                                                                           An affiliate of the Dealer has arranged \par                                                                           a swap with the Bank in connection \par                                                                           with this transaction and will receive \par                                                                           amounts thereunder that may comprise \par                                                                           compensation. \par  5.                                          Estimated Total Expenses:   None. The Dealer has agreed to pay \par                                                                           for all material expenses related \par                                                                           to the issuance of the Notes. \par  6.                                                             Codes: \par                                                       (a) Common Code:   118488032 \par                                         (b) ISIN:                        XS1184880323 \par  7.                                Identity of Dealer:                   \f28 \uc2 \