\par\par \b \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  Issue of Debt\b0\par\par\uc2 3,700 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Februar 2015\par 08:00\par \uc2 Regulatory News Service\par \uc2 RNS\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2015   \par \par \uc2 TIDM94HD\par \par \uc2 RNS Number : 7844F\par \par \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\par \par \uc2 25 February 2015\par \par \uc2 PRICING SUPPLEMENT\par \par \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\par \par \uc2 Global Debt Program\par \par \uc2 Series No: 482\par \par \uc2 Tranche No: 3\par \par \uc2 IDR 300,000,000,000 7.35 percent Notes due September 12, 2018 (the "Notes") as from February 12, 2015 to be consolidated and form a single series with the Bank's IDR 1,000,000,000,000 7.35 percent Notes due September 12, 2018, issued on September 12, 2014 (the "Series 482 Tranche 1 Notes") and the Bank's IDR 250,000,000,000 7.35 percent Notes due September 12, 2018, issued on October 16, 2014 (the "Series 482 Tranche 2 Notes")\par \par \uc2 payable in United States Dollars\par \par \uc2 Issue Price: 100.861 percent plus 150 days' accrued interest\par \par \uc2 Application has been made for the Notes to be admitted to the Official List of the \uc2 United Kingdom Listing Authority\uc2  and to trading on the \uc2 London Stock Exchange plc\uc2 's Regulated Market\par \par \uc2 Deutsche Bank\par \par \uc2 The date of this Pricing Supplement is as of February 9, 2015\par \par \uc2 Terms used herein shall be deemed to be defined as such for the purposes of the Terms and Conditions (the "Conditions") set forth in the Prospectus dated January 8, 2001 (the "Prospectus") (which for the avoidance of doubt does not constitute a prospectus for the purposes of Part VI of the United Kingdom Financial Services and Markets Act 2000 or a base prospectus for the purposes of Directive 2003/71/EC of the \uc2 European Parliament\uc2  and of the Council). This Pricing Supplement must be read in conjunction with the Prospectus. This document is issued to give details of an issue by the \uc2 Inter-American Development Bank\uc2  (the "Bank") under its Global Debt Program and to provide information supplemental to the Prospectus. Complete information in respect of the Bank and this offer of the Notes is only available on the basis of the combination of this Pricing Supplement and the Prospectus.\par \par \uc2 Terms and Conditions\par \par \uc2 The following items under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par       1.    Series No.:                      482 \par              Tranche No.:                     3 \par       2.    Aggregate Principal Amount:      IDR 300,000,000,000 \par                                               As from the Issue Date, the \par                                               Notes will be consolidated and \par                                               form a single series with the \par                                               Series 482 Tranche 1 Notes and \par                                               the Series 482 Tranche 2 Notes. \par       3.    Issue Price:                     IDR 311,770,500,000, which amount \par                                               represents the sum of (a) 100.861 \par                                               percent of the Aggregate Principal \par                                               Amount plus (b) the amount of \par                                               IDR 9,187,500,000 representing \par                                               150 days' accrued interest, \par                                               inclusive. \par                                               The Issue Price will be payable \par                                               in USD in the amount of USD \par                                               24,724,068.20 at the agreed \par                                               rate of 12,610 IDR per one USD \par       4.    Issue Date:                      February 12, 2015 \par       5.    Form of Notes \par              (Condition 1(a)):                Registered only, as further \par                                               provided in paragraph 9(c) of \par                                               "Other Relevant Terms" below. \par       6.    Authorized Denomination(s) \par               (Condition 1(b)):               IDR 10,000,000 and integral \par                                               multiples thereof \par       7.    Specified \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par              (Condition 1(d)):                The lawful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the \par                                               Republic of Indonesia ("Indonesian \par                                               Rupiah" or "IDR"), provided \par                                               that all payments in respect \par                                               of the Notes will be made in \par                                               United States Dollars ("U.S.$" \par                                               or "USD") \par       8.    Specified Principal Payment \par              \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                          USD \par              (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)): \par       9.    Specified Interest Payment \par              \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                          USD \par              (Conditions 1(d) and 7(h)): \par       10.   Maturity Date \par              (Condition 6(a); Fixed            September 12, 2018 \par              Interest Rate): \par       11.   Interest Basis \par              (Condition 5):                   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition \par                                               5(I)) \par       12.   Interest Commencement Date \par              (Condition 5(III)):               September 12, 2014 \par       13.   Fixed Interest Rate (Condition   Condition 5(I) as amended and \par              5(I)):                           supplemented below, shall apply \par                                               to the Notes. The bases of the \par                                               Calculation of the Interest \par                                               Amount, Interest Payment Dates \par                                               and default interest are as \par                                               set out below. \par  \par               (a) Interest Rate:              7.35 percent per annum \par             (b) Business Day Convention:     Following Business Day Convention \par             (c) Fixed Rate Interest \par              Payment Date(s):                  Annually on each September 12, \par                                                commencing on September 12, \par                                                2015 and ending on, and including, \par                                                the Maturity Date. \par             (d) Interest Period:             Each period from and including \par                                               each Interest Payment Date to \par                                               but excluding the next following \par                                               Interest Payment Date, provided \par                                               that the initial Interest Period \par                                               will commence on and include \par                                               the Interest Commencement Date, \par                                               and the final Interest Period \par                                               will end on but exclude the \par         