 under this heading "Terms and Conditions" are the particular terms which relate to the issue the subject of this Pricing Supplement. These are the only terms which form part of the form of Notes for such issue.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  1.    Series No.:                                              501 \par  2.    Aggregate Principal Amount:                              IDR 250,000,000,000 \par  3.    Issue Price:                                             IDR 253,500,000,000, which is 101.400 percent of the \par                                                                 Aggregate Principal Amount \par                                                                 The Issue Price will be payable in USD in the amount \par                                                                 of USD 20,159,045.73 at the agreed rate \par                                                                 of 12,575 IDR per one USD \par  4.    Issue Date:                                              February 4, 2015 \par  5.    Form of Notes \par         (Condition 1(a)):                                       Registered only, as further provided in paragraph 9(c) \par                                                                 of "Other Relevant Terms" below. \par  6.    Authorized Denomination(s) \par          (Condition 1(b)):                                       IDR 10,000,000 and integral multiples thereof \par  7.    Specified \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par         (Condition 1(d)):                                       The lawful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of the Republic of Indonesia \par                                                                 ("Indonesian Rupiah" or "IDR"), provided \par                                                                 that all payments in respect of the Notes will be made \par                                                                