ness Day Convention:                             Modified Following Business Day Convention \par        (c) Fixed Rate Interest Payment Date(s): \par                                                                 Annually on each January 22, commencing on January 22, \par                                                                 2016 and ending on, and including, \par                                                                 the Maturity Date. \par        (d) Interest Period:                                     Each period from and including each Interest Payment \par                                                                 Date to but excluding the next following \par                                                                 Interest Payment Date, provided that the initial \par                                                                 Interest Period will commence on and include \par                                                                 the Interest Commencement Date, and the final Interest \par                                                                 Period will end on but exclude the \par                                                                 Maturity Date. \par                                                                 For the purposes of the calculation of the Interest \par                                                                 Amount payable for any Interest Period, \par                                                                 there shall be no adjustment pursuant to the Business \par                                                                 Day Convention specified above. \par        (e) Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction(s): \par                                                                  Actual/Actual (ICMA) \par        (f) Calculation of Interest Amount:                      As soon as practicable and in accordance with the \par                                             