d. Accordingly, the Dealer agrees that \par                                                                 it will observe all applicable provisions of law in \par                                                                 each jurisdiction in or from which it \par                                                                 may offer or sell Notes or distribute any offering \par                                                                 material. \par  Other Relevant Terms \par  1.    Listing:                                                 Application has been made for the Notes to be admitted \par                                                                 to the Official List of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 United \par                                                                 Kingdom Listing Authority\f28 \uc2 \f2  and to trading on the \f28 \uc2 \f2 London \par                                                                 Stock Exchange plc\f28 \uc2 \f2 's Regulated Market \par                                                                 with effect from the Issue Date. \par  2.    Details of Clearance System Approved by the Bank and \par        the \par        Global Agent and Clearance and \par        Settlement Procedures:                                    \f28 \uc2 \f2 Euroclear Bank SA/NV\f28 \uc2 \f2  and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Clearstream\f28 \uc2 \f2 , Luxembourg \par  3.    Syndicated:                                              No. \par  4.    Commissions and Concessions:                             No commissions or concessions are payable in respect \par                                                                 of the Notes. An affiliate of the Dealer \par                                                                 has arranged a swap with the Bank in connection with \par                                                                 this transaction and will receive amounts \par                                                 