 not a problem for us," he said.\par \par \uc2 Write to I Made Sentana at I-made.sentana@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 December 17, 2014 06:03 ET (11:03 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141217each00145\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
