 "actively" present in the market in recent days to defend rupiah assets, central bankers said Tuesday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "We have been actively supplying [dollars] and buying government bonds," Senior Deputy Gov. Mirza Adityasawara said, adding that the rupiah has fallen beyond the IDR11,500-IDR12,000 level that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  deems good for both exports and imports.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The local unit fell to a new 16-year low of IDR12,900 to the dollar early Tuesday from IDR12,700 late Monday. Traders said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  likely sold more than $200 million at IDR12,900.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 "Now the rupiah is stabilizing around IDR12,700," Bank Indonesia Deputy Gov. Perry Warjiwo said at the same news conference.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mr. Adistyawara said the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will continue to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and bond market "to help stabilize the economy."\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Although \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves fell to $111.14 billion as of Nov. 30, it is still at a "safe level" that gives BI enough ammunition to defend the local unit, he added.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Finance Minister Bambang Brojonegoro said at the news conference that the government is standing by to buy back its bonds if necessary to stabilize the bond market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to I Made Sentana at I-made.sentana@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 December 16, 2014 02:21 ET (07:21 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020141216eacg000ob\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\