ess Day Convention:                             Modified Following Business Day Convention \par        (c) Fixed Rate Interest Payment Date(s): \par                                                                 Annually on each November 14, commencing on November \par                                                                 14, 2015 and ending on, and including, \par                                                                 the Maturity Date. \par        (d) Interest Period:                                     Each period from and including each Interest Payment \par                                                                 Date to but excluding the next following \par                                                                 Interest Payment Date, provided that the initial \par                                                                 Interest Period will commence on and include \par                                                                 the Interest Commencement Date, and the final Interest \par                                                                 Period will end on but exclude the \par                                                                 Maturity Date. \par                                                                 For the purposes of the calculation of the Interest \par                                                                 Amount payable for any Interest Period, \par                                                                 there shall be no adjustment pursuant to the Business \par                                                                 Day Convention specified above. \par        (e) Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction(s):                    Actual/Actual (ICMA) \par        (f) Calculation of Interest Amount:                      As soon as practicable and in accordance with the \par                                                                 procedure specified herein, the Calculation \par                                                                 Agent will determine the IDR Rate (as defined below) \par                                                                 and calculate the amount of interest \par                                                                 payable (the "Interest Amount") with respect to each \par                                                                 minimum Authorized Denomination for the \par                                                                 relevant Interest Period. \par                                                                 The Interest Amount with respect to any Interest \par                                                                 Period shall be a USD amount calculated on \par                                                                 the relevant Rate Fixing Date (as defined below) as \par                                                                 follows: \par                                                                 7.20% times the minimum Authorized Denomination \par                                                                 times \par                                                                 the Fixed Rate Day Count Fraction \par                                                                 divided by \par                                                                 the IDR Rate \par                                                                 (and rounding, if necessary, the entire resulting \par                                                                 figure to the nearest two decimal places, \par                                                                 with USD 0.005 being rounded upwards). \par                                                                 The "IDR Rate" means the rate determined by the \par                                                                 Calculation Agent that is equal to the IDR/USD \par                                                                 weighted average spot rate in the interbank market, \par                                                                 based on traded IDR/USD spot \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \par                                                                 transactions during a specified time period which are \par                                                                 captured on a real time basis, expressed \par                                                                 as the amount of IDR per one USD, for settlement in \par                                                                 two Business Days, as published by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank \par                                                                 Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  as the "Jakarta Interbank Spot Dollar Rate \par                                                                 USD - IDR", which appears on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \par                                                                 website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ), or as published on Thomson \par                                                                 Reuters Screen JISDOR Page, or as otherwise \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 15-12-14 0700GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par                                                                 made available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor as \par                                                                 administrator), at approximately 10:00 \par                                                                 a.m., Jakarta time, on the Rate Fixing Date. Fallback \par                                                                 Provisions apply as set out below. \par                                                                 The "Rate Fixing Date" means the date that is five (5) \par                                                                 Fixing Business Days prior to the applicable \par                                                                 Fixed Rate Interest Payment Date or Maturity Date, as \par                                                                 the case may be, provided, however, \par                                                                 that if a Price Source Disruption Event (as defined \par                                                                 below) occurs or otherwise subsists on \par                                                                 such day, the Rate Fixing Date shall be the earlier of \par                                                                 (i) the Business Day on which the Bank \par                                                                 is notified by the Calculation Agent that a Price \par                                                                 Source Disruption Event no longer subsists \par                                                                 and (ii) the date that is ten (10) Business Days after \par                                                                 such day. \par                                                                 "Fixing Business Day" means a day (other than a \par                                                                 Saturday or a Sunday) on which banks and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign \par                                                                 exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets are open for business in Jakarta. \par                                                                 "Fallback Provisions": Should no IDR/USD weighted \par                                                                 average spot rate appear on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2 's \par                                                                 website (\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.bi.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.bi.go.id}}}\uc2 \f2 ) as the "Jakarta Interbank Spot \par                                                                 Dollar Rate USD - IDR", or on Thomson \par                                                                 Reuters Screen JISDOR Page, or be otherwise made \par                                                                 available by \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank Indonesia\f28 \uc2 \f2  (or its successor \par                                                                 as administrator), on the Rate Fixing Date, then the \par                                                                 Calculation Agent shall determine that \par                                                                 a price source disruption event (a "Price Source \par                                                                 Disruption Event") has occurred, and shall \par                                                                 promptly inform the Bank and the Global Agent of such \par                                                                 occurrence. \par                                                                 Following a determination by the Calculation Agent \par                                                                 that a Price Source Disruption Event has \par                                                                 occurred, Noteholders will not be entitled to any \par                                                                 amounts in respect of the Notes until the \par                                                                 earlier to occur of (i) the date that is five (5) \par                                                                 Business Days after the date on which the \par                                                                 Bank is notified by the Calculation Agent that a Price \par                                                                 Source Disruption Event no longer subsists \par                                                                 and (ii) the Postponed Interest Payment Date (as \par                                                                 defined below) or the Postponed Maturity \par                                                                 Date (as defined below), as the case may be. \par                                                                 If a Price Source Disruption Event subsists on the \par                                                                 date that is ten (10) Business Days after \par                                                                 the original Rate Fixing Date, the IDR Rate with \par                                                                 respect to the relevant Interest Period shall \par                                                                 be determined by the Calculation Agent by requesting \par                                                                 firm quotes for the sale of IDR and the \par                                                                 purchase of USD (expressed as the number of IDR per \par                                                                 one USD) at or about 10:00 a.m., Jakarta \par                                                                 time, or as soon thereafter as is practicable on such \par                                                                 date, for settlement two Fixing Business \par                                                                 Days thereafter, from four Reference Dealers (as \par                                                                 defined below) as selected by the Calculation \par                                                                 Agent. \par                                                                 If two, three or four Reference Dealers provide such \par                                                                 firm quotes as requested, the IDR Rate \par                                                                 with respect to the relevant Interest Period will be \par                                                                 the arithmetic mean (rounded to the nearest \par                                                                 whole IDR, with IDR 0.5 being rounded upwards) of such \par                                                                 firm quotes. \par                                                                 If only one or no such firm quotes are provided as \par                                                                 requested, or if the Calculation Agent \par                                                                 determines in its sole discretion that no suitable \par                                                                 Reference Dealers active in the USD/IDR \par                                                                 \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  or \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets will provide firm \par                                                                 quotes, the Calculation Agent shall \par                                                                 be entitled to calculate the IDR/USD weighted average \par                                                                 spot rate acting in good faith in a \par                                                                 commercially reasonable manner, having taken into \par                                                                 account relevant market practice, by reference \par                                                                 to such additional sources as it 